</p>
<p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.6;">
    Agradecemos a confiança! 🙏
</p>

<div class="divider"></div>

<p style="margin:0; font-size:12px; color:#94a3b8; text-align:center; line-height:1.6;">
